================================================================================
THE STANDARDS MODEL
================================================================================

`motoko/src/Seed.mo`, `motoko/src/FormsSeed.mo` and `forms/` are generated from
the standards model published in thebes-audit-standards (Apache-2.0, Thebes Core
Team): the procedures, requirements, record kinds, disclosure catalogue and the
fourteen forms, with the sourced Arabic equivalents where the model has them.
The generators under `tools/` record the model's commit in `Seed.mo`.

================================================================================
THE VENDORED THEBES SDK
================================================================================

`frontend/vendor/@thebes/sdk/` is the Thebes frontend SDK (Apache-2.0, Mercatura
Forum), vendored as source so that the web application builds on its own. Its
own LICENSE and NOTICE are reproduced in that directory.

================================================================================
TEST FIXTURES
================================================================================

`motoko/test/fixtures/` holds recorded replies from public exchange-rate
publishers and from accounting systems used to build the connector tests; the
companies, people and figures in the demonstration firm and the test scenarios
are fictional.
